OL,3,ABonnie Tyler remembers loved ones in
OL,4,Aposthumous Christmas single
OL,5,
OL,6,FBonnie Tyler sings of "love, light and
OL,7,Fpeace" and remembers "the ones who
OL,8,Fstill live on inside our hearts" on her
OL,9,Fposthumous Christmas single, which was
OL,10,Freleased on Friday.
OL,12,FThe popular Welsh powerhouse singer,
OL,13,Fborn Gaynor Hopkins, died in July aged
OL,14,F75 after undergoing emergency
OL,15,Fintestinal surgery in Portugal earlier
OL,16,Fthis year.
OL,18,FFans were able to hear the Total
OL,19,FEclipse of the Heart singer's husky
OL,20,Ftones one more time on the festive
OL,21,Ftrack titled "Love, Light and Peace".
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
